73960367922\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/01/17/50494840/32ba195cb823a599566ec77458583850_87972470484529758.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>终焉之律者</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">推荐武器，武器主动技能扩展了角色本身的玩法机制，提升了循环和输出能力。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/01/17/50494840/ea46ed463f569590aa165da57f915316_1151807798646056048.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">主动技能造成火元素伤害，并且能提高自身对命中的目标所造成的伤害；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">终焉之律者使用时，武器技带来的加成能很好的覆盖到流程中；分支攻击可刷新武器主动技能，武器主动技能可额外获得的【降临】计数，二者相辅相成加快了输出节奏，【终末姿态】下武器技能冷却缩减加快了下一波流程的连贯性。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/01/17/50494840/ea46ed463f569590aa165da57f915316_1151807798646056048.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
